  "remarks": "1980 original. Bars and tempo follow ChordWiki; the order matches a lesson by the band's bass player. Verse chords are power chords under the riff (ChordWiki: Gm, Bb, C, F). The tab passes through F into Gm in the pre-chorus and goes from Cm7 straight to D ending the chorus. Fade: five rounds of the link.",
